# Stray clips stay out, but the five the site is built on do not. They are
# 9MB between them, which is not too big for git, and without them a clone has
# no backdrop and a build from this repo serves 404s where the forest should
# be. That is exactly what happened on the first deploy: it worked from my
# machine, because the CLI uploads local files, and broke the moment a build
# had only what was committed.
*.mp4
*.mov
!web/public/video/*.mp4
!video/rooted-demo.mp4
!video/footage/*.mp4
!video/assets/*.png

# seeded design canvas, rebuilt from design/*.dc.html
design/rooted-app-screens.html
design/img/
